{
  "name": "Lab L038 — Ingestion base_support (Qdrant)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ingestion des fiches de support (workflow A de L035)\nLit `base-connaissances/*.md` (monté dans le conteneur sur `/home/node/lab-files/support`), découpe 1 000 / 150,\nvectorise avec **Ollama nomic-embed-text** (768 dimensions, sans clé) et insère dans la collection Qdrant `support_fiches`.\nCredentials : *Qdrant local* (URL `http://qdrant:6333`, clé vide) et *Ollama local* (URL `http://ollama:11434`).\nAvant le premier lancement : `docker compose exec ollama ollama pull nomic-embed-text`.\nRelancer l'ingestion **ajoute** des doublons : videz la collection d'abord (tableau de bord Qdrant, port 6333).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "a0621fb4-ff4b-554f-8497-58afefb55b5d",
      "name": "Note — ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "d7aaec17-619d-5b42-bf07-d3a0ecde1eaa",
      "name": "Lancer l'ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fileSelector": "/home/node/lab-files/support/*.md",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a8812d06-89e1-53fc-9c83-b5acafb5f77a",
      "name": "Lire les fiches",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "qdrantCollection": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "support_fiches"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "35606d32-2c55-5dbc-868b-1e613e3a601d",
